<worksheet xml:id="sec-quiz-choice-based-voting-att-2">
  <title>Quiz: Choice-Based Voting Methods Attempt 2</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>
      Name: <fillin characters="45"/>
    </p>
  </introduction>
  <exercise xml:id="ex-quiz-choice-based-voting-att-2-plurality" workspace="0.1in">
    <statement>
      <p>Find the winner of this election under the plurality method.</p>
      <tabular row-headers="yes" halign="center" valign="middle" top="medium" left="medium" bottom="medium" right="medium">
        <row header="yes" bottom="medium">
          <cell>Number of voters</cell>
          <cell>9</cell>
          <cell>6</cell>
          <cell>12</cell>
          <cell>8</cell>
          <cell>11</cell>
          <cell>5</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>1st choice</cell>
          <cell>D</cell>
          <cell>B</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>C</cell>
          <cell>D</cell>
          <cell>B</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>2nd choice</cell>
          <cell>B</cell>
          <cell>C</cell>
          <cell>D</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>D</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>3rd choice</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>D</cell>
          <cell>C</cell>
          <cell>B</cell>
          <cell>B</cell>
          <cell>C</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>4th choice</cell>
          <cell>C</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>B</cell>
          <cell>D</cell>
          <cell>C</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
        </row>
      </tabular>
    </statement>
  </exercise>

  <exercise xml:id="ex-quiz-choice-based-voting-att-2-approval" workspace="0.1in">
    <statement>
      <p>A community group is selecting a project to support. The table summarizes an approval vote among four projects. Each column represents a group of voters with the same approvals. An X means that the voters approve of a project; a blank cell means that they do not approve of it.</p>
      <tabular row-headers="yes" halign="center" valign="middle" top="medium" left="medium" bottom="medium" right="medium">
        <row header="yes" bottom="medium">
          <cell>Number of voters</cell>
          <cell>18</cell>
          <cell>12</cell>
          <cell>21</cell>
          <cell>16</cell>
          <cell>15</cell>
          <cell>10</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>Library</cell>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell/>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>Playground</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell>X</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>Trails</cell>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>Garden</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell>X</cell>
          <cell/>
          <cell>X</cell>
        </row>
      </tabular>
      <p>Find the winner under approval voting. Also give the number of approvals received by the winner.</p>
    </statement>
  </exercise>

  <exercise xml:id="ex-quiz-choice-based-voting-att-2-irv" workspace="2in">
    <statement>
      <p>A class is choosing a destination for a field trip: an aquarium (A), a zoo (Z), or a museum (M). The preference schedule is shown below.</p>
      <tabular row-headers="yes" halign="center" valign="middle" top="medium" left="medium" bottom="medium" right="medium">
        <row header="yes" bottom="medium">
          <cell>Number of voters</cell>
          <cell>10</cell>
          <cell>9</cell>
          <cell>6</cell>
          <cell>12</cell>
          <cell>8</cell>
          <cell>15</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>1st choice</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>Z</cell>
          <cell>M</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>M</cell>
          <cell>Z</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>2nd choice</cell>
          <cell>Z</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>M</cell>
          <cell>Z</cell>
          <cell>M</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>3rd choice</cell>
          <cell>M</cell>
          <cell>M</cell>
          <cell>Z</cell>
          <cell>Z</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
          <cell>A</cell>
        </row>
      </tabular>
      <p>Find the winner of this election under Instant Runoff Voting (IRV), also called Ranked-Choice Voting. Also give the final vote total for the winner.</p>
    </statement>
  </exercise>
</worksheet>
